                </Box>
                <Box style={{ flex: 1, flexDirection: 'column', gap: 2 }}>
                    <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#20344B' }}>Brain 决定做法，内核守住事实边界</Text>
